## Consequences

- This repository is a **mixed-licence collection**. `LICENSE` (MIT) describes
  the original work only. Everything outside the lists above is MIT, and the
  models and symbols say so in the file.
- The ScottoKeebs content under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 **blocks commercial
  distribution** of the collection as it stands.
- `Fuse_PPTC1.stp` is **CC BY-ND 4.0**, which forbids derivative works; it is
  the only file in the collection under a NoDerivatives licence.
- Before a v1.0.0 release: replace the Scotto models with original work or
  obtain permission; check the licence of `KailhSocket.stp` and the other
  copied models; keep the SnapEDA, Samacsys and kiswitch attributions with the
  files.

